### 4. Create portfolio -> 201 (id 1)
POST {{host}}/api/portfolios
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Retirement", "ownerEmail": "Ada@Example.com" }

### Duplicate name, same owner -> 409
POST {{host}}/api/portfolios
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Retirement", "ownerEmail": "ada@example.com" }

### Bad email -> 400
POST {{host}}/api/portfolios
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "X", "ownerEmail": "not-an-email" }

### List -> 200
GET {{host}}/api/portfolios?ownerEmail=ada@example.com

### List without email -> 400
GET {{host}}/api/portfolios

### Get -> 200
GET {{host}}/api/portfolios/1

### Unknown -> 404, detail "Portfolio 999 does not exist."
GET {{host}}/api/portfolios/999

### Delete empty portfolio -> 204 (don't run on portfolio 1 yet; create a throwaway first)